---
source: crates/rustman-cli/src/tests.rs
expression: help
---
Store a private key in the OS keychain as signer <ID>

Usage: rustman evm signer import [OPTIONS] <ID>

Arguments:
  <ID>
          The signer id, as used in [evm.signers.<ID>] and `signer:`

Options:
      --color <WHEN>
          Color: auto (a terminal without NO_COLOR or TERM=dumb), always or never
          
          [default: auto]

  -v, --verbose...
          Log more on stderr: -v requests, -vv headers, -vvv everything (RUST_LOG, when set, replaces these levels)

  -h, --help
          Print help
